  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPPF Core - Advancing SRHR by strengthening Grassroots Organisations and Countering Efforts to Roll Back Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver on multiple objectives: expanding access to comprehensive services including HIV and abortion, reaching very marginalised people, supporting bottom-up movements which link the grassroots to the international level, and strategic transnational efforts to counter anti-rights actors in multiple ODA eligible countries across the world.</narrative>
  </description>
